  "description": "The after-Levias state with the Water Dragon's part of the Song of the Hero already learned: Faron flooded, all tadtones collected, and her part of the song in the inventory. Link loads in Faron Woods where the game puts him after her song. The Eldin and Lanayru parts are still to do. Name and Hero Mode are kept.",
  "scope": "slot",
